<h3>11.2 带 Dropout 和 BatchNorm 的 MLP</h3>
<div class="code-block">
<div class="code-header">regularized_mlp.py</div>
<pre><span class="kw">class</span> <span class="cls">RegularizedMLP</span>(nn.Module):
    <span class="str">"""带 Dropout 和 BatchNorm 的 MLP"""</span>
    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">__init__</span>(self, in_dim, hidden_dims, out_dim, dropout=<span class="num">0.5</span>):
        <span class="cls">super</span>().__init__()
        layers = []
        prev = in_dim
        <span class="kw">for</span> h <span class="kw">in</span> hidden_dims:
            layers.append(nn.Linear(prev, h))
            layers.append(nn.BatchNorm1d(h))
            layers.append(nn.ReLU(inplace=<span class="kw">True</span>))
            layers.append(nn.Dropout(dropout))
            prev = h
        layers.append(nn.Linear(prev, out_dim))
        self.net = nn.Sequential(*layers)

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">forward</span>(self, x):
        <span class="kw">return</span> self.net(x)

<span class="com"># 训练/推理模式切换</span>
model = RegularizedMLP(<span class="num">784</span>, [<span class="num">512</span>, <span class="num">256</span>], <span class="num">10</span>, dropout=<span class="num">0.3</span>)
model.train()  <span class="com"># 启用 Dropout 和 BN 更新</span>
model.eval()   <span class="com"># 禁用 Dropout，BN 使用 running stats</span></pre>
</div>

<h3>11.3 手动实现反向传播</h3>
<div class="code-block">
<div class="code-header">manual_backprop.py</div>
<pre><span class="str">"""手动实现 2 层 MLP 的前向 + 反向传播（不使用 autograd）"""</span>
<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np

<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">relu</span>(x): <span class="kw">return</span> np.maximum(<span class="num">0</span>, x)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">relu_grad</span>(x): <span class="kw">return</span> (x > <span class="num">0</span>).astype(float)
<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">softmax</span>(x):
    e = np.exp(x - x.max(axis=<span class="num">1</span>, keepdims=<span class="kw">True</span>))
    <span class="kw">return</span> e / e.sum(axis=<span class="num">1</span>, keepdims=<span class="kw">True</span>)

<span class="com"># 初始化</span>
W1 = np.random.randn(<span class="num">784</span>, <span class="num">128</span>) * np.sqrt(<span class="num">2.</span> / <span class="num">784</span>)
b1 = np.zeros(<span class="num">128</span>)
W2 = np.random.randn(<span class="num">128</span>, <span class="num">10</span>) * np.sqrt(<span class="num">2.</span> / <span class="num">128</span>)
b2 = np.zeros(<span class="num">10</span>)

<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">forward_backward</span>(X, y, lr=<span class="num">0.01</span>):
    <span class="com"># 前向传播</span>
    z1 = X @ W1 + b1          <span class="com"># (B, 128)</span>
    a1 = relu(z1)             <span class="com"># (B, 128)</span>
    z2 = a1 @ W2 + b2         <span class="com"># (B, 10)</span>
    probs = softmax(z2)       <span class="com"># (B, 10)</span>

    <span class="com"># 反向传播</span>
    B = X.shape[<span class="num">0</span>]
    dz2 = (probs - y) / B     <span class="com"># Softmax+CE 的梯度 = probs - y</span>
    dW2 = a1.T @ dz2          <span class="com"># (128, 10)</span>
    db2 = dz2.sum(axis=<span class="num">0</span>)     <span class="com"># (10,)</span>
    da1 = dz2 @ W2.T          <span class="com"># (B, 128)</span>
    dz1 = da1 * relu_grad(z1) <span class="com"># 逐元素乘激活导数</span>
    dW1 = X.T @ dz1           <span class="com"># (784, 128)</span>
    db1 = dz1.sum(axis=<span class="num">0</span>)     <span class="com"># (128,)</span>

    <span class="com"># 参数更新（SGD）</span>
    W1 -= lr * dW1; b1 -= lr * db1
    W2 -= lr * dW2; b2 -= lr * db2
    <span class="kw">return</span> -np.log(probs[np.arange(B), y.argmax(axis=<span class="num">1</span>)]).mean()</pre>
</div>

<h3>11.4 完整训练循环</h3>
<div class="code-block">
<div class="code-header">train_loop.py</div>
<pre><span class="kw">import</span> torch
<span class="kw">import</span> torch.nn <span class="kw">as</span> nn
<span class="kw">from</span> torch.optim <span class="kw">import</span> AdamW
<span class="kw">from</span> torch.utils.data <span class="kw">import</span> DataLoader, TensorDataset

<span class="com"># 数据</span>
X = torch.randn(<span class="num">60000</span>, <span class="num">784</span>)
y = torch.randint(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">10</span>, (<span class="num">60000</span>,))
loader = DataLoader(TensorDataset(X, y), batch_size=<span class="num">128</span>, shuffle=<span class="kw">True</span>)

<span class="com"># 模型 + 优化器 + 损失</span>
model = RegularizedMLP(<span class="num">784</span>, [<span class="num">256</span>, <span class="num">128</span>], <span class="num">10</span>, dropout=<span class="num">0.3</span>)
optimizer = AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=<span class="num">1e-3</span>, weight_decay=<span class="num">1e-4</span>)
criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()

<span class="com"># Cosine 学习率调度</span>
scheduler = torch.optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, T_max=<span class="num">30</span>)

<span class="kw">for</span> epoch <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">30</span>):
    model.train()
    total_loss = <span class="num">0</span>
    <span class="kw">for</span> X_batch, y_batch <span class="kw">in</span> loader:
        optimizer.zero_grad()
        logits = model(X_batch)
        loss = criterion(logits, y_batch)
        loss.backward()
        optimizer.step()
        total_loss += loss.item()
    scheduler.step()
    <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Epoch {epoch+1}: loss={total_loss/len(loader):.4f}, lr={scheduler.get_last_lr()[0]:.6f}"</span>)</pre>
</div>

<h3>11.5 MLP 实现自编码器</h3>
<div class="code-block">
<div class="code-header">autoencoder.py</div>
<pre><span class="kw">class</span> <span class="cls">Autoencoder</span>(nn.Module):
    <span class="str">"""MLP 自编码器：压缩 → 重建"""</span>
    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">__init__</span>(self, input_dim=<span class="num">784</span>, latent_dim=<span class="num">32</span>):
        <span class="cls">super</span>().__init__()
        <span class="com"># 编码器 MLP</span>
        self.encoder = nn.Sequential(
            nn.Linear(input_dim, <span class="num">256</span>), nn.ReLU(),
            nn.Linear(<span class="num">256</span>, <span class="num">128</span>), nn.ReLU(),
            nn.Linear(<span class="num">128</span>, latent_dim)
        )
        <span class="com"># 解码器 MLP</span>
        self.decoder = nn.Sequential(
            nn.Linear(latent_dim, <span class="num">128</span>), nn.ReLU(),
            nn.Linear(<span class="num">128</span>, <span class="num">256</span>), nn.ReLU(),
            nn.Linear(<span class="num">256</span>, input_dim), nn.Sigmoid()
        )

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">forward</span>(self, x):
        z = self.encoder(x)
        <span class="kw">return</span> self.decoder(z), z

<span class="com"># 训练自编码器</span>
model = Autoencoder(<span class="num">784</span>, <span class="num">32</span>)
optimizer = AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=<span class="num">1e-3</span>)
<span class="kw">for</span> x, _ <span class="kw">in</span> loader:
    recon, z = model(x)
    loss = nn.functional.mse_loss(recon, x)  <span class="com"># 重建损失</span>
    optimizer.zero_grad(); loss.backward(); optimizer.step()</pre>
</div>

<h3>11.6 学习率调度可视化</h3>
<div class="code-block">
<div class="code-header">lr_schedule.py</div>
<pre><span class="kw">class</span> <span class="cls">WarmupCosineScheduler</span>:
    <span class="str">"""Warmup + Cosine Annealing 学习率调度"""</span>
    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">__init__</span>(self, optimizer, warmup_steps, total_steps, max_lr, min_lr):
        self.opt = optimizer
        self.warmup = warmup_steps
        self.total = total_steps
        self.max_lr = max_lr
        self.min_lr = min_lr
        self.step_count = <span class="num">0</span>

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">step</span>(self):
        self.step_count += <span class="num">1</span>
        <span class="kw">if</span> self.step_count <= self.warmup:
            <span class="com"># 线性 warmup</span>
            lr = self.max_lr * self.step_count / self.warmup
        <span class="kw">else</span>:
            <span class="com"># 余弦退火</span>
            progress = (self.step_count - self.warmup) / (self.total - self.warmup)
            lr = self.min_lr + <span class="num">0.5</span> * (self.max_lr - self.min_lr) * (<span class="num">1</span> + np.cos(np.pi * progress))
        <span class="kw">for</span> g <span class="kw">in</span> self.opt.param_groups:
            g[<span class="str">'lr'</span>] = lr

<span class="com"># 使用：前 500 步 warmup，之后余弦退火</span>
scheduler = WarmupCosineScheduler(optimizer, warmup_steps=<span class="num">500</span>,
                                  total_steps=<span class="num">10000</span>, max_lr=<span class="num">1e-3</span>, min_lr=<span class="num">1e-6</span>)</pre>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ========== 第十二章 ========== -->
<section id="ch12">
<h2><span class="num">12</span>MLP vs 现代架构</h2>

<p>MLP 是所有深度学习架构的"公因数"。理解 MLP 与现代架构的关系，有助于把握深度学习的全景。</p>

<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead><tr><th>维度</th><th>MLP</th><th>CNN</th><th>RNN</th><th>Transformer</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>连接方式</td><td>全连接</td><td>局部连接 + 权值共享</td><td>循环连接</td><td>全局注意力</td></tr>
<tr><td>参数量</td><td>最多</td><td>最少（权值共享）</td><td>中等</td><td>较多</td></tr>
<tr><td>归纳偏置</td><td>无</td><td>局部性 + 平移不变性</td><td>时间因果性</td><td>排列等变性</td></tr>
<tr><td>适合数据</td><td>表格数据</td><td>图像/视频</td><td>序列/时间</td><td>序列/集合</td></tr>
<tr><td>FFN 子层</td><td>—</td><td>分类头</td><td>门控</td><td>FFN（本质是 MLP）</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>

<div class="callout">
<div class="callout-title">MLP 在现代架构中的位置</div>
<p><strong>CNN</strong> = 局部连接的 MLP + 权值共享。<strong>RNN</strong> = 时间维度上权重共享的 MLP + 循环连接。<strong>Transformer</strong> = 注意力层 + MLP（FFN 子层）。可以说，<em>一切深度学习架构都是 MLP 的变体或组合</em>。</p>
</div>

<h3>12.1 MLP Mixer：纯 MLP 的视觉模型</h3>
<p>2021 年，Tolstikhin 等人提出的 MLP-Mixer 证明了纯 MLP 架构在图像分类上也能取得竞争力。它将图像分为 patches，交替在 patch 维度和通道维度上做 MLP，完全不用卷积和注意力——展现了 MLP 在充分数据下的潜力。</p>

<h3>12.2 gMLP 与现代 MLP 复兴</h3>
<p>2021 年，Liu 等人提出 gMLP（Gated MLP），通过门控机制赋予 MLP处理序列的对齐能力，在机器翻译任务上媲美 Transformer。这表明 MLP 的表达能力被长期低估，在架构创新和数据规模持续增长的今天仍有巨大潜力。</p>
</section>

<!-- ========== 第十三章 ========== -->
<section id="ch13">
<h2><span class="num">13</span>演进时间线与总结</h2>

<div class="timeline">
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">1943</div>
<div class="event">McCulloch & Pitts 提出第一个人工神经元模型（M-P 模型）</div>
<div class="desc">将神经元抽象为二值逻辑门，奠定神经网络数学基础</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">1958</div>
<div class="event">Rosenblatt 提出感知机（Perceptron）</div>
<div class="desc">第一个可学习的神经网络，引入权重更新规则</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">1969</div>
<div class="event">Minsky & Papert 证明单层感知机无法解决 XOR 问题</div>
<div class="desc">神经网络第一次寒冬开始，研究停滞近 20 年</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">1986</div>
<div class="event">Rumelhart, Hinton & Williams 发表反向传播算法</div>
<div class="desc">MLP 的诞生，多层网络训练成为可能，第二次浪潮</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">1989</div>
<div class="event">Hornik 证明通用近似定理；LeCun 将 MLP 用于手写数字识别</div>
<div class="desc">理论保障 + 实际应用，但受限于算力和数据</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">1998</div>
<div class="event">LeCun 提出 LeNet（CNN），MLP 逐渐被 CNN 超越</div>
<div class="desc">卷积的权值共享在图像任务上全面优于全连接</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">2010</div>
<div class="event">Nair & Hinton 提出 ReLU 激活函数</div>
<div class="desc">解决梯度消失问题，使深层 MLP 训练成为可能</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">2014</div>
<div class="event">Dropout（Srivastava）和 Batch Normalization（Ioffe）相继提出</div>
<div class="desc">正则化技术突破，深度网络训练更加稳定</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">2015</div>
<div class="event">He et al. 提出 He 初始化；Adam 优化器发表</div>
<div class="desc">初始化 + 优化器双突破，MLP 训练走向成熟</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">2017</div>
<div class="event">Transformer 架构发表，FFN 子层即为 MLP</div>
<div class="desc">MLP 成为 Transformer 的核心组件之一</div>
</div>
<div class="timeline-item">
<div class="year">2021</div>
<div class="event">MLP-Mixer 和 gMLP 提出，纯 MLP 架构复兴</div>
<div class="desc">证明在大数据下 MLP 可媲美 CNN 和 Transformer</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="callout success">
<div class="callout-title">总结</div>
<p>MLP 是深度学习的<strong>起源</strong>和<strong>基础</strong>。从 1943 年的 M-P 模型到 2021 年的 MLP-Mixer，MLP 经历了诞生（1986）、被超越（1998）、重生（2010）和复兴（2021）的完整循环。其核心思想——<em>线性变换 + 非线性激活的逐层堆叠</em>——至今仍是所有神经网络架构的基本范式。理解 MLP 的前向传播、反向传播、激活函数、优化器和正则化，就掌握了深度学习的通用语言。</p>
</div>
</section>

